{"id":"n67462-2-10","stage":3,"title":"연못 · 莲池","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67462-2-10-1","ko":"우리 개구리 잡으러 가자!","zh":"我们一起去抓青蛙吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"개구리","meaning":"青蛙","explanation":"개구리：青蛙","readings":[{"term":"개구리","audio":"/audio/d3566aef7f819cdb65fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64364","senseId":"1","lemma":"개구리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개구리","audio":"/audio/d3566aef7f819cdb65fe.mp3"}},{"text":"잡으러","meaning":"抓，捕","explanation":"잡다：抓，捕；으러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"2","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡으러","audio":"/audio/d8941225b8c989f6513f.mp3"}},{"text":"가자!","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자","audio":"/audio/9d6a16e0f490c47dce42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"d3566aef7f819cdb","term":"개구리","zh":"青蛙","audio":"/audio/d3566aef7f819cdb65fe.mp3","entryId":"64364","definition":"一种生活在水田或河流等地的动物。四脚长有脚蹼，擅长游泳，后腿很长，善于弹跳，能通过鸣囊的膨胀发出声音。","pronunciation":["개구리"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，捕","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"捉住放在手里。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e72f112915245baa131f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67462-2-10-2","ko":"좋아. 요 앞 연못에 가면 잡을 수 있을 거야.","zh":"好啊。去前面那个池塘的话应该能抓到哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"요","meaning":"这个","explanation":"요：这个","readings":[{"term":"요","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67862","senseId":"1","lemma":"요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3"}},{"text":"앞","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}},{"text":"연못에","meaning":"莲池，荷塘，池塘","explanation":"연못：莲池，荷塘，池塘；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"연못","audio":"/audio/1e8ce1be9b0afe49f28d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67462","senseId":"2","lemma":"연못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연못에","audio":"/audio/31e76ae28d71110453e9.mp3"}},{"text":"가면","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가면","audio":"/audio/3f7693768451c0cae806.mp3"}},{"text":"잡을","meaning":"抓，捕","explanation":"잡다：抓，捕；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"2","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡을","audio":"/audio/c41ec2d041eb2f9d7e34.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"d525e7107305db85","term":"요","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3","entryId":"67862","definition":"(贬称)(昵称)用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["요"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"1e8ce1be9b0afe49","term":"연못","zh":"莲池，荷塘，池塘","audio":"/audio/1e8ce1be9b0afe49f28d.mp3","entryId":"67462","definition":"蓄水的、挖得深且宽的地方。","pronunciation":["연몯"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，捕","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"捉住放在手里。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/634aee34d72a740f80b3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.222,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67462","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9473,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊。去前面那个池塘的话应该能抓到哦。","我们一起去抓青蛙吧！","结婚之后您要辞职吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们一起去抓青蛙吧！","结婚之后您要辞职吗？","好啊。去前面那个池塘的话应该能抓到哦。"],"answer":2}]}
